  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the Government of China in achieving their national Land Degradation Neutrality (LDN) targets by strengthening policy frameworks, enhancing capacities, improving ecosystem services, and securing financing for sustainable management of natural forest use land (NFUL). Aligned with the GEF-7 Land Degradation Focal Area Objective 2, the project adopts a multi-level governance approach for forest landscape restoration and sustainable management. It seeks to restore 83,000</narrative>
